      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bdf852ca0a24d415f725912871c6a12c0b685d5dfa91c97738fd80f0f067b40d:000000_-4799622088364782530:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "今日もアマササさんと遊びに出かけていたのだが、\nとても良い天気なのに、傘を持っているのが気になった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "804cab92a508a981fe67ade96262371529cb516d8eada5efa2634cf018f61fba",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そういえば、アマササさんはいつも傘を持っていますよね。\n今日みたいな良い天気でも……なんでですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "96f43e74db7e771b1b389630e5987e6bc31c583036bc4a4a9fde288f70784251",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그러고 보니 아마사사 씨는 늘 우산을 들고 다니시네요.\n오늘처럼 날씨가 좋은 날에도……왜죠?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bdf852ca0a24d415f725912871c6a12c0b685d5dfa91c97738fd80f0f067b40d:000000_-4799622088364782530:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そういえば、アマササさんはいつも傘を持っていますよね。\n今日みたいな良い天気でも……なんでですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "cd0b572ec6bc900da454f89ad585cc258b2bd03e8da0a86c86dab6546ebbb980",
